e":"paragraph","text":"きっとわかります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ど忘れもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時はごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれ担当万理華の秋に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"注目してるアイテムは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんですかー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋物の服を買いに行きたいんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オススメとか流行りものを教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンズで、ワンポイントなにか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイテムを使うとしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どういうのが好きorオススメかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行とか実はあまり詳しくない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は今タイトスカートと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クロップドパンツ気になる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、スウェットパンツを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服として着こなしたり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋服が英国とかおじさんのイメージが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるからテーラードジャケットは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着まわしできそう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーわからん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな参考にしないでください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなキャラクターはいますか？☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、そんなにないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛絶対に切る事しないよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロングのままだよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありゃ。切らないでほしい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ切る予定ないけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたらいつの間にか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バッサリ!!!!!とかあるかもね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近仕事中にまりかのことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"想ってて、仕事になりません(´Д｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたらいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、だめよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事応援してます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファイっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子中学生に好きって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言われて嬉しいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しくないわけない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーの中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットにしたい人ゎ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ってる帽子の中で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1番何色の帽子が多い??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パープルが2色ある..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはばらばら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るい色はそんなに持ってないな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝負事をする時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"必ずやる事ってあったりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜お願いごとする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママにはトンカツとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作ってもらってたなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いとうちゃんず片割れの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元岐阜にはいったことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよーーーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお口をあけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てるのですか？(^_^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなわけ...っっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいものを見るのがすきだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガラスケースに飾られた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キッチュでカラフルな雑貨を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るのがすきだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その雑貨達を両手いっぱいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抱えてみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボロボロこぼれ落ちるくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おにゃのこの夢だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーお部屋をかわいいもので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいにしたいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいつけ襟。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/25/7482527/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみなさい。‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-hd2e20e41cf":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はMJの公開収録でしたー！\nみんな、放送お楽しみに*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいろんな人に会ったのー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、SOLのセカオワLOCKS！のラジオドラマ企画にゲスト出演させてもらったので、\nSEKAI NO OWARIさんにお礼とご挨拶しに行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽番組で一緒になったりすることは多かったんだけど、バタバタしていてきちんとご挨拶したことがなかったので\n今日お会いできて良かった(o^^o)\nみなさんとても優しかった